{"events.values() order from nodestore.backend.get_multi() may not align with error_ids order, causing wrong event data to be associated with wrong IDs when zipping": 0.9145852327346802, "Feature-flag path passes empty columns and empty tableData to TableWidgetVisualization, causing blank tables even when results exist": 0.9964325428009033, "Mutual-exclusion validation for age/timestamp uses truthy-based check with self.initial_data.get(...) which treats 0 as falsey - should use key presence check instead": 0.8372138142585754, "Analytics event is recorded before feature flag check, meaning analytics will be recorded for all requests including those that return 404 due to feature being disabled": 0.759802520275116, "_truncate_title can return a string longer than max_length because it adds '...' after slicing - should slice to max_length - 3 before appending ellipsis": 0.9022723436355591, "Broad exception catch (Exception) may hide underlying issues - should catch more specific exceptions like NodeStoreError, KeyError": 0.0949212908744812, "Typo in comment: 'segements' should be 'segments'": 0.13620547950267792, "TriggerLabelWrap renders a span while Flex renders a div - nesting div inside span can break inline layout/ellipsis behavior": 0.6036995649337769, "When useApiQuery is disabled or idle, data can be undefined, so data.summary will throw and break the page for orgs without the feature flag": 0.8657277822494507, "Custom renderers that return falsy React nodes (0, '', false, null) are treated as 'no render' due to truthy check - should use explicit undefined check": 0.9048902988433838, "Meta is missing the 'id' column - rows include 'id' but meta.fields/meta.units don't list it, leading to undefined metadata lookups": 0.4455585181713104, "Typo in story text: duplicated 'the' in 'Below is the the most basic example'": 0.047788459807634354, "UseGetTraceItemAttributeValuesProps extends UseTraceItemAttributeBaseProps which provides projects?: Project[], but hook uses projectIds?: PageFilters['projects'] (number[]) - incompatible types": 0.5009839534759521, "useGetTraceItemAttributeValues call defaults to page filters instead of using provided projectIds prop, returning results from wrong project scope": 0.297309935092926, "requests.post call lacks a timeout, which could cause tests to hang indefinitely if Snuba is unresponsive": 0.25972864031791687, "HIDDEN_ATTRIBUTES filter is only applied when searchQuery is present - when searchQuery is empty, hidden attributes like is_segment, project_id, received will still be visible": 0.9048504829406738, "request.user.id may raise an error if the user is anonymous when recording analytics": 0.7193087339401245}